  "summary": "武曲破军同坐巳亥为双星杀破狼，开创强但宜左右或禄存增稳。少吉多煞时可能冲动投机、求财起伏及亲情不利；是否破祖丧家须合星曜与父母生年差异，不能照古语一概断定。现代离乡发展须合命迁两宫，技术谋生也不限武破组合。",
  "summary_en": "Wu Qu and Po Jun share Si or Hai as a double-star Sha Po Lang configuration. Strong initiative needs Left-Right support or co-located Lu Cun for stability. Few benefics and many harmful stars may bring impulsiveness, speculation, financial swings and family difficulties. Whether family disruption occurs depends on the actual stars and individual parental birth-year differences. Modern opportunities do not necessarily require leaving home; the Life and Travel Palaces must be assessed together. Technical livelihoods under heavy affliction are not exclusive to Wu Qu–Po Jun.",
